{% set local_problem %}
<p>Decatur's climate is tough on fascia boards. The Tennessee River's influence keeps humidity high throughout much of the year. When gutters clog or leak, water runs behind them and soaks into the fascia. In Decatur's humid environment, that moisture doesn't dry out — it creates perfect conditions for rot, mold, and wood-destroying insects.</p>

<p>Historic homes in downtown Decatur and the Bank Street area face particular challenges. Many still have original fascia boards that have weathered decades of exposure. The wood is often already compromised, and any gutter problems quickly accelerate the deterioration.</p>

<p>Even newer Decatur construction isn't immune. Builder-grade materials and humid conditions combine to cause fascia problems faster than in drier climates. We frequently find significant rot on homes less than 20 years old.</p>

<p>The good news: caught early, fascia repair is straightforward and affordable. Left alone, rot spreads to rafters, roof sheathing, and structural components — turning a $500 repair into a $5,000+ problem.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>We start with a thorough inspection, checking fascia and soffit for water damage, soft spots, and rot. We'll show you exactly what we find and explain what needs repair — no hidden damage, no surprise charges.</p>

<p>For damaged sections, we carefully remove existing gutters, cut out the rotted wood back to solid material, and install new fascia boards. We use quality primed lumber or composite materials designed for exterior exposure in humid climates.</p>

<p>Everything is properly sealed and prepared for new gutter installation. Then we install your new seamless gutters on the fresh fascia — properly attached, properly sloped, and designed to prevent the overflow that caused the rot in the first place.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set why_us %}
<p>We've been repairing fascia and installing gutters throughout Decatur for over 20 years. We understand that these two jobs go hand-in-hand — you can't have reliable gutters without solid fascia, and you can't protect fascia without properly functioning gutters.</p>

<p>Our crews handle both carpentry and gutter installation, which means better coordination, cleaner work, and a single point of accountability. Based just 25 minutes away in Huntsville, we're here when you need us — and we stand behind our work.</p>
